## Verdict thẳng

**Import PPTX đã dùng được cho self-hosted best-effort.** Không “ok 100%”, không đủ bằng chứng cho 1:1 PowerPoint, full editability, hay visual fidelity release.

| Capability | Verdict | Ghi chú ngắn |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Best-effort import → editor | **Usable** | Upload → job → projection → open |
| Original package recovery | **Strong** | Immutable R0 / download original |
| Browser layout health (corpus) | **Green (heuristic)** | ~5 deck / 227 slide structural pass (2026-07-22) |
| Reliability (cancel/drain/crash) | **Mostly shipped** | P1–P3 plan `completed`; residual honesty items |
| Strict native importer | **Blocked** | EMF + unmapped native leaves trên deck thật |
| PowerPoint visual 1:1 | **Blocked** | Oracle goldens placeholder; P0 phase 4 blocked |
| Native chart / L4 edit | **Not available** | preserve-only; package-first G4 open |
| Validated edited-package export | **Bounded / fail-closed** | Software contracts; OfficeCLI/native qual open |
| Multi-tenant job auth | **Out of model** | Single-tenant self-host |

**Product claim an toàn hôm nay:**

> Best-effort PPTX import tạo projection editable trong NavSlides và giữ nguyên file gốc để recovery. Feature phức tạp có thể preserve / approximate / read-only / placeholder.

**Không được nói:** 100% compatible, pixel-perfect, mọi content editable, strict corpus = strict native, roundtrip = PowerPoint semantics.

