## Pipeline thực tế (end-to-end)

```text
HomePage chọn .pptx
  → POST /api/pptx/import  (upload quota chỉ POST; busy + Retry-After)
  → reserve in-memory job (trước Multer body)
  → temp file (tmp-pptx-imports/)
  → fork parse-worker (env allowlist, heap/timeout)
       → ZIP/CRC/XML/resource guards (CRC fail-closed)
       → pptxtojson only (không runtime fallback parser)
       → output usability
  → host re-open + revalidate package
  → OOXML scene graph (inventory truth)
  → mapper → canvas 960×540 (pt = px @ 72 DPI)
  → chart/SmartArt OOXML supplement
  → scene reconcile + source map
  → bounded import report + warning budget
  → package-store commit: R0 immutable + head gen=1
  → outbox sole-writer → drain compatibility (listable barrier)
  → media commit → complete job
  → client SSE/poll (AbortController + 150s wait budget)
  → open /editor/:id  (chỉ khi listable / ownership còn)
```

**Hai “đường” fidelity (quan trọng khi debug):**

1. **Best-effort projection** — dùng hằng ngày: `pptxtojson` + mapper + warnings.
2. **Package authority** — R0 + generation + source map + (tương lai) patch export / OfficeCLI — owner plan package-first; claim gates **G0–G5 đều còn open**.

